      "writtenOn": "2021-06-01T11:10:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\n\nFor now it\u0027s difficult because apex activation should be done before any other processes except static executables like init/ueventd/linkerconfig or bootstrap binaries like apexd.\n\nWe might need to make microdroid_manager \"static\" or \"bootstrap\" so that it can start before apexd.\n\nBesides, I think that DICE derivation can be done in a separate execution mode (e.g. microdroid_manager --dice). Otherwise, microdroid_manager should do what init can do better.",
      "parentUuid": "34b43c2e_416ae69a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
